fixture kindle_on_cling_frame_goes_away
doc Movement review 6, M3; docs/adr/0010 Wall, "A press on the tick the player reaches a wall is a press on the wall". Kindle cast forward on the tick the fall clings to the shaft wall (24) goes away from the wall, as one cast a tick later from the cling does (kindle_from_cling_goes_away). Before the fix the cone went right, through the 32 u wall and past it.
room test/shaft
option flame 33
spawn 690 100
frames 50
input
  0..9
  10..23 R
  24 R spell
  25..49 R
end
expect
  at 24 event.wall_cling=1 event.cast=1 spell=kindle
  at 24 spell_dir_x=-1 spell_dir_y=0 facing=-1
end
